"\"Master\" antenna in the X axis (in direction of 0 deg yaw, positive "
"offsets are if \"Master\" is in front of the \"Slave\"."
msgstr ""
":ref:`GPS1_MB_OFS_X<GPS1_MB_OFS_X>`：从「从」天线到「主」天线在 X 轴（0 "
