"\"Master\" antenna in the Z axis (in direction up and down, positive offsets"
" are if \"Master\" below the \"Slave\"."
msgstr ""
":ref:`GPS1_MB_OFS_Z<GPS1_MB_OFS_Z>`：从「从」天线到「主」天线在 Z "
"轴（上下方向）上的偏移量（米），正值表示「主」天线在「从」天线下方。"

