#: 6749570159ac44418f07a55cd45d6fd6
msgid ""
"For ultimate positioning precision in the centimeter ranges, the offset of "
"the \"Master\" antenna from the vehicle's CG can optionally be entered to "
"compensate for attitude effects on GPS accuracy. The offsets from the CG are"
" entered into:"
msgstr "为实现厘米级的极致定位精度，可以选填「主」天线相对于机体重心的偏移量，以补偿姿态对 GPS 精度的影响。重心偏移量填写到："

