":ref:`GPS1_POS_X<GPS1_POS_X>`: offset in meters from the Center of Gravity "
"to \"Master\" antenna in the X axis (in direction of 0 deg yaw, positive "
"offsets are if \"Master\" is in front of the Center of Gravity."
