#: c1c26daf1a1e4d09aee149da50f2ada8
msgid ""
":ref:`GPS2_POS_Z<GPS1_POS_Z>`: offset in meters from the Center of Gravity "
"to \"Master\" antenna in the Z axis (in direction up and down, positive "
"offsets are if \"Master\" below the Center of Gravity."
msgstr ""
":ref:`GPS2_POS_Z<GPS1_POS_Z>`：从重心到「主」天线在 Z 轴（上下方向）上的偏移量（米），正值表示「主」天线在重心下方。"

